**Test filters.** For this step these gates run only the tests their filter selects (plus any inherited expected-red tests); put the tests this step adds or changes where a filter value finds them:
- `constructor-unit-tests`: 

**How to implement.** The design history and the project report leave `Report.fs`, because each exists only over the `.ocproj` aggregate (001 §R '`.ocproj`: `ProjectFile`, the `ProjectJson` project aggregate and the `Project` record'; the S4.4 brief: a module that also serves another live surface keeps that surface and loses only the project path). (1) `OpticalConstructor.Storage/Report.fs`: the module `DesignHistory` (`Report.fs:DesignHistory`: `ChangeKind`, `DiffIdentity`, `DiffItem`, `ProjectDiff`, `historyFolder`, `appendRevision`, `layerDiff`, `diffRevisions`) and the module `Report` (`Report.fs:Report`: `ReportFormat`, `reportsDir`, `ReportChart`, `reportDocument`, `generate`) are deleted with their docs. Nothing outside `Report.fs` and `ExportImportTests.fs` names them, and no window ever called `generate`. The module `MaterialLibrary` (`Report.fs:MaterialLibrary`) stays unchanged in this step: the metadata-only material file is a surface of its own, and step 160 gives it its own schema. Every `open` left unused goes, `Giraffe.ViewEngine`, `OpticalConstructor.Storage.Export` and `OpticalConstructor.Domain.Project` among them. (2) `OpticalConstructor.Storage.fsproj`: the `Giraffe.ViewEngine.StrongName` package reference and the three-line comment above it (`OpticalConstructor.Storage.fsproj:73-76`) are deleted, because the report HTML was Storage's only use of it; the central `PackageVersion` in the root `Directory.Build.targets` is not touched. The comment above `RecentFiles.fs`'s `<Compile>` (`:32-34`) is cut to the words that stay true, naming no report, design history or `ChartHandle` dependency of `Report`; nothing is added (AGENTS.md). `Export.fs`'s `ChartHandle` and `exportChartImage` (`Export.fs:Export`) stay as Export's own chart-image surface (§I.7). (3) Tests: in `OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExportImportTests.fs`, `AC-I11 appendRevision twice yields two numbered snapshots and diffRevisions returns a ProjectDiff` is deleted with the fixtures only it used (`filmThickness`, `vacuumSystem`, `light`, `node` and `sampleProject`, `ExportImportTests.fs:141-183` in today's tree) and the opens they alone needed (`OpticalConstructor.Domain.Project`, `OpticalConstructor.Storage.DesignHistory` and any other left unused). The module doc (`:23-24`) drops its design-history clause. Every other fact of the class keeps its name and assertions. Afterwards `git grep -n -E "DesignHistory|appendRevision|diffRevisions|ProjectDiff|ReportFormat|Giraffe" -- Berreman/OpticalConstructor/` finds nothing.

**Acceptance.** After the design history and the project report leave `Report.fs`, `git grep -n -E "DesignHistory|appendRevision|diffRevisions|ProjectDiff|ReportFormat|Giraffe" -- Berreman/OpticalConstructor/` MUST find nothing and the material file's import and export MUST behave as before; constructor-unit-tests MUST pass, every other ExportImportTests fact unchanged, the count falling by 1; and build, elevation and the twelve s18 invariants MUST pass.
